category: Libs
requires: libbliss0 libgmp-devel pkg-config
sdesc: "Graphs, isomorphism, and canonical labeling (development)"
ldesc: "bliss is an open-source tool for computing canonical labelings and
automorphism groups of graphs. Its algorithms are described in the following
papers, please cite them if you use bliss in your research or software tools."
external-source: bliss

